          "Permission": {
            "value": "<table class=\"layouttemplate\" style=\"margin:.25em; padding:.25em .5em; background-color:var(--color-inverted, #ffffff); color: inherit; border:1px solid #003399;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/ba/Flag_of_Germany.svg/40px-Flag_of_Germany.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/ba/Flag_of_Germany.svg/60px-Flag_of_Germany.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1000\" data-file-height=\"600\"></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>Dieser Text und viele andere auch sind ebenso in deutscher Sprache verfügbar. Um diese sehen zu können, wähle bitte auf dieser Webseite die Spracheinstellung „Deutsch“.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:HSSection_sign.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/18/HSSection_sign.svg/120px-HSSection_sign.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/18/HSSection_sign.svg/250px-HSSection_sign.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"156\" data-file-height=\"156\"></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Cc_by-sa_(1).svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1c/Cc_by-sa_%281%29.svg/120px-Cc_by-sa_%281%29.svg.p