Attribution</b></span><span class=\"ui-button-icon-secondary ui-icon ui-icon-extlink\"> </span></span></a></span></div>\n<div style=\"margin-top:0.5em;\">As an alternative to the named Creative Commons License <i>CC BY-SA 4.0</i> the <i><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Free_Art_License\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Free Art License\">Free Art License</a></i> (<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artlibre.org/licence/lal/en/\">from Version 1.3</a>) may also be used.</div>\n<div style=\"margin-top:0.75em;\"><b>II. Fairness</b></div>\n<div style=\"margin-top:0.5em;\">From printed matter and other material products that use this photography, the user is asked to send me a copy as a thank you. However, this is not a condition for the use of photography. The postal address can be requested via the contact options.</div>\n<div style=\"margin-top:0.5em;\">Please note that I had a significant effort to make this photography. Therefore, it can only be fair to comply with the terms of the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Free_license\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Free license\">free license</a> listed here. In case of non-compliance with the license conditions, the granted rights of use understandably expire automatically.</div>\n<div style=\"margin-top:0.75em; clear: both;\"><b>III. Disclaimer</b></div>\n<div style=\"margin-top:0.5em;\">Please note that the granting of the rights from the license relates exclusively to the photography itself, but not on the rights to the depicted object (e.g. copyright or property rights) or the personality rights of any persons depicted. I do not assume that the further use of photography intended by you is legally possible with regard to the depicted object or the depicted person. You are responsible for checking and observing these rights when publishing in the respective medium or country.</div>\n<div style=\"margin-top:0.5em;\">I do not guarantee the accuracy of the information given here (description, title, etc.). The <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Commons:General_disclaimer\" title=\"Commons:General disclaimer\">general disclaimer</a> applies.</div>\n<div style=\"margin-top:0.75em;\"><b>IV. Contact options</b></div>\n<div style=\"margin-top:0.5em;\"><b><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:UserIconMail.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ea/UserIconMail.svg/40px-UserIconMail.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ea/UserIconMail.svg/60px-UserIconMail.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"700\" data-file-height=\"700\"></a></span> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"mailto:f.riedelio@wikipedia.de\">E-mail to the author</a></b> or via the <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/User_talk:F._Riedelio\" title=\"User talk:F. Riedelio\">discussion page of the author</a>.</div>",
